{"skill":{"slug":"wrk","displayName":"wrk"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1782699508666,"changelog":"- Initial release of the wrk load testing skill.\n- Provides thorough usage documentation for wrk, including recommended safety steps and output interpretation.\n- Includes step-by-step examples for basic and advanced wrk usage, such as load testing with randomized X-Forwarded-For headers using Lua scripting.\n- Offers example Lua scripts for custom request generation and guidance on starting parameters.\n- Lists key points to check before running tests and highlights potential pitfalls.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7722,"sha256":"5e54dfedf84786860fdfd35d1fa1ec5beb9e8d5b021ac7d705c3f216630555da","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2164,"sha256":"dea54538ea799b05ac01cdce60cea71f7f0d42256cbf2cee0b829f00ea7c5f22","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789551981952,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"9b6e22531f8bfdd87e2b0d430e92776195f1cd3926e41d5782ced84a16206080","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9b6e22531f8bfdd87e2b0d430e92776195f1cd3926e41d5782ced84a16206080","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1782699713195},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":9,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789551981952},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed wrk load-testing guide with a risky but purpose-aligned example for randomized client IP headers that users should only apply in authorized test environments.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The requested environment access is proportionate to running a local benchmarking tool against user-selected HTTP targets, with guidance to avoid uncontrolled third-party or production testing.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation metadata only requires the wrk binary via Homebrew; no bundled executable scripts, remote payload retrieval, or unusual install behavior were present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions include clear safety scoping around authorization, staging/sandbox preference, gradual scaling, and warnings about production disruption, though the IP-header randomization examples remain sensitive and should be used narrowly.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, credential harvesting, memory modification, services, scheduled tasks, or tool wrapping were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill teaches HTTP load testing with wrk and Lua scripting; randomized X-Forwarded-For/X-Real-IP examples are explicitly part of the stated purpose and are framed for authorized controlled testing.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you need wrk load-testing help. Use the randomized X-Forwarded-For examples only on systems you own or are explicitly authorized to test, and avoid using them to bypass rate limits, abuse controls, logging, or attribution on third-party or production services.","findings":"[SDI-2] expected: The finding is artifact-supported because the skill provides ready-to-run Lua examples that randomize X-Forwarded-For and X-Real-IP headers; this is sensitive because it can affect logs, rate limits, and attribution, but it is disclosed, user-invoked, tied to load-testing scenarios, and accompanied by authorization and safety warnings.\n[AIG-SARIF] expected: The supplied static scan reported no T01-T09 results; local inspection likewise found only Markdown instructions and no embedded executable payloads or persistence mechanisms.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789551981952}}}}}